sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as 用户
    participant F as chat.js (前端)
    participant API as routers/chats.py
    participant S as scheduler
    participant P as pipeline.run_chat
    participant LLM as llm/mock
    participant DB as SQLite
    participant WS as events.hub

    Note over U,DB: 阶段一：新建 chat（快照全局资料）
    U->>F: 点「新建对话」
    F->>API: POST /api/chats
    API->>DB: 读全局 Profile → 深拷贝为 Chat.profile_snapshot
    API->>DB: INSERT Chat(status=draft)
    API-->>F: ChatOut
    F->>F: 渲染空对话区 + 资料条

    Note over U,DB: 阶段二：贴 JD
    U->>F: 粘贴岗位要求 → 发送
    F->>API: POST /api/chats/{id}/messages {kind:jd}
    API->>DB: INSERT ChatMessage(jd) + 更新 Chat.raw_text
    API->>WS: broadcast chat_message
    WS-->>F: chat_message
    F->>F: 追加 user 气泡

    Note over U,DB: 阶段三：生成（可选：先编辑 chat 内资料快照）
    U->>F: 点「生成简历」
    F->>API: POST /api/chats/{id}/generate
    API->>API: 校验(有JD、未运行)
    API->>S: enqueue(chat_id)
    API-->>F: 202 ChatOut(queued)
    S->>DB: 条件 UPDATE 抢占 → running
    S->>WS: broadcast chat_updated(running)
    S->>P: run_chat(chat_id)

    P->>DB: 载入 profile_snapshot + raw_text
    P->>WS: chat_progress 10%
    P->>LLM: 岗位解析（分节 + requirements + employer_questions）
    LLM-->>P: analysis
    P->>DB: 存 Chat.job_analysis
    P->>WS: chat_progress 25%
    P->>LLM: 生成 spec + coverage（覆盖全部需求/标注依据）
    LLM-->>P: spec + coverage
    P->>WS: chat_progress 60%
    P->>P: render_resume_html(spec)
    P->>DB: INSERT Resume(chat_id, html, spec, coverage)
    P->>DB: Chat.status=succeeded
    P->>WS: chat_progress 100% + chat_updated + chat_message(notice)
    WS-->>F: 事件
    F->>F: 显示「查看简历 / 查看覆盖清单」

    Note over U,DB: 阶段四：查看产出
    U->>F: 点「查看简历」
    F->>API: GET /api/resumes/{resume_id}
    API-->>F: ResumeOut(html, spec, coverage)
    F->>F: switchView("resume") → resume.js 工作台
    F->>F: 匹配分析 tab 渲染覆盖清单(grounded/capability)
